# TAG Enum Development Guidelines

## Enum Template

    enum [ID] "TAG [EnumName]"
    {
        Extensible = true;
        Caption = '[Enum Caption]';

        value(0; " ")
        {
            Caption = ' ';
        }
        value(1; "Option1")
        {
            Caption = 'Option 1';
        }
        value(2; "Option2")
        {
            Caption = 'Option 2';
        }
    }

## Enum Naming Conventions

- Enum name: TAG [DescriptiveName]
- Use PascalCase for value names
- Include spaces in multi-word captions
- Start with value(0; " ") for optional fields

## Common TAG Enums

### Status Enums

    enum [ID] "TAG Work Order Status"
    {
        Extensible = true;
        
        value(0; " ") { Caption = ' '; }
        value(1; Planned) { Caption = 'Planned'; }
        value(2; Released) { Caption = 'Released'; }
        value(3; "In Progress") { Caption = 'In Progress'; }
        value(4; Completed) { Caption = 'Completed'; }
        value(5; Cancelled) { Caption = 'Cancelled'; }
    }

### Type Enums

    enum [ID] "TAG Equipment Type"
    {
        Extensible = true;
        
        value(0; " ") { Caption = ' '; }
        value(1; Asset) { Caption = 'Asset'; }
        value(2; Location) { Caption = 'Location'; }
        value(3; Component) { Caption = 'Component'; }
    }

## Enum Extensions

    enumextension [ID] "TAG [BaseEnum] Extension" extends "[BaseEnum]"
    {
        value(100; "TAG Custom Value")
        {
            Caption = 'TAG Custom Value';
        }
    }

## Using Enums in Tables

    field(10; Status; Enum "TAG Work Order Status")
    {
        DataClassification = CustomerContent;
        Caption = 'Status';
    }

    field(15; Type; Enum "TAG Equipment Type")
    {
        DataClassification = CustomerContent;
        InitValue = Asset;
        ValuesAllowed = Asset, Location;
    }

## Enum Value Numbering

- 0: Empty/blank option
- 1-99: Core values
- 100+: Extension values

Leave gaps for future additions within each range.

## Best Practices

- Always set Extensible = true for partner extensibility
- Provide meaningful Captions for UI display
- Use Enum instead of Option for new development
- Keep enum values descriptive and self-documenting